Description: Command-line interface to a Wiren Board controller
 wb-cli provides a structured CLI for managing Wiren Board controllers.
 It supports MQTT, Modbus, systemd, journal, network, cloud agent,
 automation rules, configuration, and system diagnostics.
 .
 Output is JSON by default, designed for both human operators and
 LLM-driven automation via SSH.
